D07\",\n131:    \"feature_id\": \"F06\"\n132:   },\n133:   {\n134:    \"acceptance_id\": \"A01\",\n135:    \"basis\": \"The source IndexedDB/Dexie implementation is not the target Python/SQLite persistence implementation; correct target rationale while preserving restart assertion.\",\n136:    \"decision_id\": \"D08\",\n137:    \"feature_id\": \"F08\"\n138:   },\n139:   {\n140:    \"acceptance_id\": \"A09\",\n141:    \"basis\": \"HTML soft-delete/restore recovery must be exercised; category deletion also needs trashed records to remain recoverable.\",\n142:    \"decision_id\": \"D04\",\n143:    \"feature_id\": \"F09\"\n144:   },\n145:   {\n146:    \"acceptance_id\": \"A10\",\n147:    \"basis\": \"Malformed requests and form validation need explicit non-mutating feedback/recovery; retain JSON bad_request and existing API behavior.\",\n148:    \"decision_id\": null,\n149:    \"feature_id\": \"F10\"\n150:   },\n151:   {\n152:    \"acceptance_id\": \"A02\",\n153:    \"basis\": \"Correct the URL boundary from dotted-host rejection to absolute parseable HTTP(S) with a valid nonempty hostname.\",\n154:    \"decision_id\": null,\n155:    \"feature_id\": \"F10\"\n156:   },\n157:   {\n158:    \"acceptance_id\": \"A12\",\n159:    \"basis\": \"Invalid category input must retain failure/no-mutation semantics with usable HTML feedback.\",\n160:    \"decision_id\": \"D03\",\n161:    \"feature_id\": \"F10\"\n162:   },\n163:   {\n164:    \"acceptance_id\": \"A11\",\n165:    \"basis\": \"The target shell is Python server-rendered HTML, not the source SPA mount; preserve the empty-library readiness contract.\",\n166:    \"decision_id\": \"D08\",\n167:    \"feature_id\": \"F11\"\n168:   }\n169:  ],\n170:  \"version\": \"atlas.aggregate-repair-scope.v1\"\n171: }","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file source/REPAIR_SCOPE.json, lines 1-171\n1: {\n2:  \"authored_field_paths\": [\n3:   [\n4:    \"architecture_markdown\"\n5:   ]