     \"feature_id\": \"F01\",\n866:      \"navigation\": \"成功后 303 到 /?category=<归类> 或 /，浏览器显示新记录行。\",\n867:      \"recovery\": \"失败页保留已填 url/title/description/category，用户修正后重新提交；也可返回列表。\",\n868:      \"success_state\": \"303 返回首页，新记录出现在所选归类，GET /api/bookmarks/{id} 返回同一原始 URL；SQLite 行已持久化。\"\n869:     },\n870:     {\n871:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n872:       \"A03\"\n873:      ],\n874:      \"action\": \"不另选归类直接保存；首启查看预置归类。\",\n875:      \"design_basis\": \"场景 workflow 3：未经整理的链接先进入默认归类，之后再移动；成熟产品普遍提供未被整理收件区。\",\n876:      \"entry\": \"首页保存表单的 category 字段（默认「未整理」）与侧栏/归类页的预置归类列表。\",\n877:      \"failure\": \"默认归类缺失或写入失败时返回明确错误页或 JSON 错误，不伪装成功。\",\n878:      \"feature_id\": \"F02\",\n879:      \"navigation\": \"303 到首页或未整理归类视图。\",\n880:      \"recovery\": \"重试保存；应用启动时在事务中补齐预置归类。\",\n881:      \"success_state\": \"记录的 category_id 为默认「未整理」，可在 /?category=未整理 看到；“未整理”“待购”“家居改造”“以后看看”均可见。\"\n882:     },\n883:     {\n884:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n885:       \"A04\"\n886:      ],\n887:      \"action\": \"在真实表单提交 name 新建/重命名，提交 category_id 删除；删除默认归类被拒绝。\",\n888:      \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 3 与 workflow 2：用户可新建归类并把记录放入合适位置；源包没有 collections，属目标新设计。\",\n889:      \"entry\": \"首页 a[data-testid=category-manager] 进入 /categories；该页含 category-create-form、category-rename-form、category-delete-form。\",\n890:      \"error_branch_ids\": [\n891:       \"html.category_create.name.omitted\",\n892:       \"html.category_create.name.empty\",\n893:       \"html.category_create.name.whitespace\",\n894:       \"html.category_create.name.overlong_121\",\n895:       \"html.category_rename.name.omitted\",\n896:       \"html.category_rename.name.empty\",\n897:       \"html.category_rename.name.whitespace\",\n898:       \"html.category_rename.name.overlong_121\",\n899:       \"json.category_create.name.omitted\",\n900:       \"json.category_create.name.empty\",\n901:       \"json.category_create.name.whitespace\",\n902:       \"json.category_create.name.overlong_121\",\n903:       \"json.category_create.name.null\",\n904:       \"json.category_rename.name.omitted\",\n905:       \"json.category_rename.name.empty\",\n906:       \"json.category_rename.name.whitespace\",\n907:       \"json.category_rename.name.overlong_121\",\n908:       \"json.category_rename.name.null\"\n909:      ],\n910:      \"failure\": \"重名 409 duplicate_category、空名/超长 400 invalid_name、默认归类 400 protected_category；页面显示 form-error 且数据不变。\",\n911:      \"feature_id\": \"F03\",\n912:      \"navigation\": \"创建/重命名/删除成功后 303 到 /categories。\",\n913:      \"recovery\": \"保留已填 name/category_id 并允许改正或选择其他归类；可返回 /categories 重试。\",\n914:      \"success_state\": \"303 到 /categories；新建/重命名可见且计数正确；删除归类后其活动与软删除记录都迁回「未整理」，软删记录仍可恢复。\"\n915:     },\n916:     {\n917:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n918:       \"A05\",\n919:       \"A12\"\n920:      ],\n921:      \"action\": \"选择目标归类（API 归类 ID）并提交；HTML 适配器把 ID 翻译为归类名后调用现有 move 服务。\",\n922:      \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 3 与 workflow 3：记录可在归类之间移动，重新打开后仍保持新归属。\",\n923:      \"entry\": \"每条 tr[data-testid=record-row] 内的 form[data-testid=record-move-form]，含 input record_id 与 select name=category_id。\",\n924:      \"error_branch_ids\": [\n925:       \"html.bookmark_save.category.empty\",\n926:       \"html.bookmark_save.category.whitespace\",\n927:       \"html.bookmark_save.category.overlong_121\",\n928:       \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.omitted\",\n929:       \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.empty\",\n930:       \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.unknown_id\",\n931:       \"json.bookmark_save.category.empty\",\n932:       \"json.bookmark_save.category.whitespace\",\n933:       \"json.bookmark_save.category.overlong_121\",\n934:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.empty\",\n935:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.whitespace\",\n936:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.overlong_121\",\n937:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.omitted\",\n938:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.null\"\n939:      ],\n940:      \"failure\": \"空/超长/非法归类 400 invalid_category，未知 record_id 404 not_found；不移动、不写入。\",\n941:      \"feature_id\": \"F04\",\n942:      \"navigation\": \"成功后 303 到 /?category=<目标归类> 或来源视图。\",\n943:      \"recovery\": \"保留选择并显示 form-error；用户改选有效归类或返回列表重试。\",\n944:      \"success_state\": \"303 回列表；记录离开原归类并出现在目标归类，JSON 的 category 与持久化结果一致。\"\n945:     },\n946:     {\n947:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n948:       \"A06\"\n949:      ],\n950:      \"action\": \"点击归类链接或从搜索表单选择归类并查看列表。\",\n951:      \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 4：用户通过归类浏览找回记录；来源标签计数被调整为按归类聚合。\",\n952:      \"entry\": \"首页侧栏 [data-testid=category-count][data-category-id] 与归类链接；/categories 同显计数；GET /?category=<name>。\",\n953:      \"failure\": \"未知归类返回空结果而非 5xx；计数查询失败显示错误页。\",\n954:      \"feature_id\": \"F05\",\n955:      \"navigation\": \"GET /?category=... 或 GET /categories；无记录时显示明确空状态。\",\n956:      \"recovery\": \"选择其他归类或清空筛选。\",\n957:      \"success_state\": \"页面只列该归类活动记录；HTML count 与 JSON count 都等于活动（未软删）记录数；移动、删除、恢复后仍一致。\"\n958:     },\n959:     {\n960:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n961:       \"A07\"\n962:      ],\n963:      \"action\": \"选择归类、输入关键字并提交。\",\n964:      \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 4：用户凭记得的关键字找回已存链接；来源仅搜标题，目标扩展到可识别来源的字段。\",\n965:      \"entry\": \"首页 form[data-testid=category-search-form]，字段 category（归类名）与 q；action 为 GET /。\",\n966:      \"failure\": \"无匹配不是错误（200 + 空结果）；非法请求返回可读错误且不写入。\",\n967:      \"feature_id\": \"F06\",\n968:      \"navigation\": \"GET /?category=...&q=...，同一页面更新结果。\",\n969:      \"recovery\": \"修改 q 或切换归类重新提交；清空 q 恢复归类浏览。\",\n970:      \"success_state\": \"URL 与表单保留 category 与 q；页面显示所选归类、保留查询和匹配行；同一关键字在两个归类分别命中各自记录；无匹配显示明确空结果；JSON 返回匹配集。\"\n971:     },\n972:     {\n973:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n974:       \"A08\"\n975:      ],\n976:      \"action\": \"用户点击打开链接。\",\n977:      \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 2 与 workflow 5：打开记录即回到保存时的外部网页，库只保证引用而非内容。\",\n978:      \"entry\": \"记录行 a[data-testid=record-open-link] 与 GET /go/{id}。\",\n979:      \"failure\": \"未知 id 404 not_found；目标不可达不影响库中记录可读。\",\n980:      \"feature_id\": \"F07\",\n981:      \"navigation\": \"浏览器导航到原始 URL（新标签）；服务端只发 302。\",\n982:      \"recovery\": \"返回收藏列表选择其他记录；如 URL 有误，可由现有 PATCH API 更新并重算 hostname。\",\n983:      \"success_state\": \"链接 href 恰为保存时原始 URL，target=_blank、rel 含 noopener；GET /go/{id} 302 Location 为同一字符串；P0 不请求目标页。\"\n984:     },\n985:     {\n986:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n987:       \"A01\",\n988:       \"A05\",\n989:       \"A09\"\n990:      ],\n991:      \"action\": \"执行真实写操作，停止应用进程，再以同一实例目录重启并读取。\",\n992:      \"design_basis\": \"场景验收 1：主动保存的链接在多次会话之间持久保留；目标以 SQLite 实现本地单用户持久化。\",\n993:      \"entry\": \"保存、移动、删除/恢复等写操作后重新请求页面；重启适配器从同一 app_root 与实例数据目录启动。\",\n994:      \"failure\": \"数据库不可写或损坏时返回明确 5xx 错误页而非成功假象；事务回滚保持旧状态。\",\n995:      \"feature_id\": \"F08\",\n996:      \"navigation\": \"无自动导航；下次 GET / 读取持久状态。\",\n997:      \"recovery\": \"恢复可写数据目录后重试；重启应用重新初始化 schema。\",\n998:      \"success_state\": \"重启后 id、原始 URL、标题、描述、归类与 trashed 状态与写入后一致；HTML 与 JSON 都来自 SQLite。\"\n999:     },\n1000:     {\n1001:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n1002:       \"A09\"\n1003:      ],\n1004:      \"action\": \"提交 record_id 软删除；在回收站提交 record_id 恢复。\",\n1005:      \"design_basis\": \"场景要求可恢复的失败；来源仅有归档记录的瞬时 Undo，目标改为显式软删除与恢复。\",\n1006:      \"entry\": \"记录行 form[data-testid=record-delete-form]；GET /?trash=1 的软删记录行 form[data-testid=record-restore-form]。\",\n1007:      \"failure\": \"未知 record_id 404 not_found；失败不改变 trashed_at，不产生 5xx。\",\n1008:      \"feature_id\": \"F09\",\n1009:      \"navigation\": \"删除成功 303 到 /?trash=1；恢复成功 303 到恢复后归类。\",\n1010:      \"recovery\": \"回收站提供可提交的恢复表单；失败可重试或返回列表。\",\n1011:      \"success_state\": \"默认视图与计数排除软删记录，回收站仍显示；恢复后原始字段与归类回归并重新可见；归类删除后软删记录仍在「未整理」可恢复。\"\n1012:     },\n1013:     {\n1014:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n1015:       \"A02\",\n1016:       \"A10\",\n1017:       \"A12\"\n1018:      ],\n1019:      \"action\": \"提交非法 URL、空/超长/非法归类、畸形 JSON 或未知 ID。\",\n1020:      \"design_basis\": \"场景要求非法输入可恢复；源表单校验被调整为服务端 HTML 表单与 JSON API 共用的显式错误合同。\",\n1021:      \"entry\": \"所有 HTML 表单（保存、归类、移动、删除、恢复、搜索）与 JSON API 端点。\",\n1022:      \"error_branch_ids\": [\n1023:       \"html.bookmark_save.category.empty\",\n1024:       \"html.bookmark_save.category.whitespace\",\n1025:       \"html.bookmark_save.category.overlong_121\",\n1026:       \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.omitted\",\n1027:       \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.empty\",\n1028:       \"html.bookmark_move.category_id.unknown_id\",\n1029:       \"json.bookmark_save.category.empty\",\n1030:       \"json.bookmark_save.category.whitespace\",\n1031:       \"json.bookmark_save.category.overlong_121\",\n1032:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.empty\",\n1033:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.whitespace\",\n1034:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.overlong_121\",\n1035:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.omitted\",\n1036:       \"json.bookmark_move.category.null\"\n1037:      ],\n1038:      \"failure\": \"出现 5xx、静默写入或不可恢复的错误页即视为失败。\",\n1039:      \"feature_id\": \"F10\",\n1040:      \"navigation\": \"HTML 错误留在当前表单页并保留输入；JSON 无导航。\",\n1041:      \"recovery\": \"修正字段后重新提交；失败页保留可运行的表单或返回链接。\",\n1042:      \"success_state\": \"错误路径本身成功执行：JSON 返回 400/404/409 与结构化错误码，HTML 返回 400/409 与 form-error；畸形 JSON 为 bad_request；均无 5xx、无写入。\"\n1043:     },\n1044:     {\n1045:      \"acceptance_ids\": [\n1046:       \"A11\"\n1047:      ],\n1048:      \"action\": \"首启或空库时打开首页。\",\n1049:      \"design_basis\": \"场景是单用户本地工具，需要可打开的应用入口；目标采用 Python 服务端渲染外壳而非来源 SPA。\",\n1050:      \"entry\": \"GET / 与 GET /api/health。\",\n1051:      \"failure\": \"健康检查非 200/非 JSON、首页 5xx 或缺少表单时显式失败。\",\n1052:      \"feature_id\": \"F11\",\n1053:      \"navigation\": \"无自动导航（首页即入口）；可进入 /categories 或归类筛选。\",\n1054:      \"recovery\": \"启动或重启应用；修复后刷新首页。\",\n1055:      \"success_state\": \"200 text/html；含保存表单 name=url、归类管理链接、记录列表/空状态容器；预置归类与空库不报错；health 200 JSON。\"\n1056:     }\n1057:    ],\n1058:    \"review_rules_version\": \"atlas.current-required-contract.v1\",\n1059:    \"schema\": \"atlas.contract-coverage.v1\"\n1060:   },\n1061:   \"decisions\": [\n1062:    {\n1063:     \"default\": \"单选归类（bookmark.category_id 标量外键）。场景流程明确“选择一个简单归类”，单归属让移动、计数与浏览语义无歧义；未来若需多值可迁移到关联表而不丢数据。\",\n1064:     \"id\": \"D01\",\n1065:     \"impact\": \"决定数据模型（标量外键 vs 关联表）以及浏览、计数与检索的实现路径。\",\n1066:     \"question\": \"记录应归属于单一“归类”，还是允许像标签一样同时属于多个？\",\n1067:     \"status\": \"decided\",\n1068:     \"when_to_ask\": \"当真实用户反馈同一条记录必须同时属于多个主题，或需要跨主题交叉检索时再评估多标签。\"\n1069:    },\n1070:    {\n1071:     \"default\": \"落入默认“未整理”，保存始终成功。场景流程第3步要求未经整理的链接可先进入默认归类，快速保存不应打断浏览。\",\n1072:     \"id\": \"D02\",\n1073:     \"impact\": \"决定保存接口是否允许缺省 category，以及首启预置数据内容。\",\n1074:     \"question\": \"保存时不选归类，应阻止保存还是落入默认“未整理”？\",\n1075:     \"status\": \"decided\",\n1076:     \"when_to_ask\": \"当目标用户群要求强制归类（例如团队共享库）时再改为必选。\"\n1077:    },\n1078:    {\n1079:     \"default\": \"自动创建（名称大小写不敏感去重），重名则复用现有归类；保持保存流程不中断。\",\n1080:     \"id\": \"D03\",\n1081:     \"impact\": \"决定 categories 的唯一约束、写入事务边界与 409/400 的语义；HTML 归类表单与 JSON API 共用服务层，重名、非法名与默认归类保护都不得产生部分写入。\",\n1082:     \"question\": \"在保存或移动界面输入一个尚不存在的归类名，应自动创建还是报错？\",\n1083:     \"status\": \"decided\",\n1084:     \"when_to_ask\": \"当出现拼写错误导致归类碎片化的证据时，改为只允许从既有归类中选择。\"\n1085:    },\n1086:    {\n1087:     \"default\": \"软删除：记录标记 trashed_at，默认视图排除，提供撤销恢复；场景要求可恢复的失败。\",\n1088:     \"id\": \"D04\",\n1089:     \"impact\": \"决定数据模型的 trashed_at 列、默认列表过滤条件、/restore 恢复路径，以及删除归类时活动与软删记录同迁默认归类；不引入 purge 或永久删除接口。\",\n1090:     \"question\": \"删除是立即物理删除，还是软删除到可恢复区并支持短时撤销？\",\n1091:     \"status\": \"decided\",\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 1092]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"source/SPECIFICATION.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1792434490364,"end":1792434490574}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792434490576,"sessionID":"ses_eaa94523effeoyw605cqbs3XcA","part":{"partID":"prt_1556bcc47001mZE2LUMa7UBnwh","sessionID":"ses_eaa94523effeoyw605cqbs3XcA","messageID":"msg_1556bc66c001BBT4tJkB4o4uCe","type":"tool","id":"call_01_1cc0PwSQ5cv4nOg9Yg0b3024","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"source/previous/acceptance/p0_find_open.py"},"output":"Read file source/previous/acceptance/p0_find_open.py, lines 1-268\n1: #!/usr/bin/env python3\n2: '''P0 行为验收组：关键字检索与打开原页。\n3: \n4: 覆盖 A07、A08。仅使用 Python 3.12 标准库并复用 acceptance/common.py：\n5: 以 --case 派发，未知用例显式失败；每个用例对真实目标执行正向与硬负向\n6: 行为断言，向 stdout 输出单个 atlas.acceptance-result.v1 JSON，失败时以\n7: 非零码退出。\n8: '''\n9: \n10: from __future__ import annotations\n11: \n12: import os\n13: import sys\n14: import uuid\n15: from urllib.parse import quote\n16: \n17: _THIS_DIR = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n18: if _THIS_DIR not in sys.path:\n19:     sys.path.insert(0, _THIS_DIR)\n20: \n21: import common\n22: \n23: \n24: def _unique_url(tag):\n25:     token = f'{tag}-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n26:     return f'https://{token}.atlas-acceptance.example/{token}'\n27: \n28: \n29: def _unique_category(tag):\n30:     return f'atlas-{tag}-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:10]}'\n31: \n32: \n33: def _safe_json(response):\n34:     try:\n35:         return response.json()\n36:     except Exception:\n37:         return None\n38: \n39: \n40: def _extract_record(payload):\n41:     if isinstance(payload, dict):\n42:         for key in ('bookmark', 'record', 'data', 'item'):\n43:             value = payload.get(key)\n44:             if isinstance(value, dict):\n45:                 return value\n46:         return payload\n47:     return None\n48: \n49: \n50: def _record_id(record):\n51:     if isinstance(record, dict) and record.get('id') is not None:\n52:         return str(record['id'])\n53:     return None\n54: \n55: \n56: def _record_url(record):\n57:     if isinstance(record, dict) and record.get('url') is not None:\n58:         return str(record['url'])\n59:     return None\n60: \n61: \n62: def _record_ids(records):\n63:     return {item_id for item_id in (_record_id(record) for record in records) if item_id}\n64: \n65: \n66: def _error_code(response):\n67:     payload = _safe_json(response)\n68:     if isinstance(payload, dict):\n69:         error = payload.get('error')\n70:         if isinstance(error, dict) and error.get('code') is not None:\n71:             return str(error['code'])\n72:         for key in ('code', 'error_code'):\n73:             if payload.get(key) is not None:\n74:                 return str(payload[key])\n75:     return None\n76: \n77: \n78: def _extract_list(payload, keys):\n79:     if isinstance(payload, list):\n80:         return payload\n81:     if isinstance(payload, dict):\n82:         for key in keys:\n83:             value = payload.get(key)\n84:             if isinstance(value, list):\n85:                 return value\n86:     return None\n87: \n88: \n89: def _bookmark_path(bookmark_id):\n90:     return '/api/bookmarks/' + quote(str(bookmark_id), safe='')\n91: \n92: \n93: def _go_path(bookmark_id):\n94:     return '/go/' + quote(str(bookmark_id), safe='')\n95: \n96: \n97: def _search(client, recorder, aid, params):\n98:     response = client.get('/api/bookmarks', params=params)\n99:     recorder.expect_status(response, 200, aid=f'{aid}-status')\n100:     payload = _safe_json(response)\n101:     records = _extract_list(payload, ('bookmarks', 'items', 'data', 'records'))\n102:     recorder.check(\n103:         f'{aid}-shape',\n104:         isinstance(records, list),\n105:         f'GET /api/bookmarks 必须返回 JSON 数组，实际 {type(payload).__name__}',\n106:     )\n107:     return records if isinstance(records, list) else []\n108: \n109: \n110: def _case_a07(args, recorder):\n111:     client = common.HttpClient(args.base_url)\n112:     try:\n113:         health = client.get('/api/health')\n114:         recorder.expect_status(health, 200, aid='a07-health-status')\n115: \n116:         cat_a = _unique_category('a07a')\n117:         cat_b = _unique_category('a07b')\n118:         shared = f'shared{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n119:         host_token = f'host{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n120:         desc_token = f'descr{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n121:         unmatched = f'absent{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n122: \n123:         url_a = f'https://{host_token}.atlas-acceptance.example/notes/{uuid.uuid4().hex[:10]}'\n124:         title_a = f'{shared} 收藏甲'\n125:         desc_a = f'备注 {desc_token}'\n126:         created_a = client.post_json(\n127:             '/api/bookmarks',\n128:             {'url': url_a, 'title': title_a, 'description': desc_a, 'category': cat_a},\n129:         )\n130:         recorder.expect_status(created_a, 201, aid='a07-create-a-status')\n131:         id_a = _record_id(_extract_record(_safe_json(created_a)))\n132:         recorder.check('a07-create-a-id', bool(id_a), f'创建记录甲返回 id={id_a!r}')\n133: \n134:         url_b = _unique_url('a07b')\n135:         title_b = f'{shared} 收藏乙'\n136:         created_b = client.post_json('/api/bookmarks', {'url': url_b, 'title': title_b, 'category': cat_b})\n137:         recorder.expect_status(created_b, 201, aid='a07-create-b-status')\n138:         id_b = _record_id(_extract_record(_safe_json(created_b)))\n139:         recorder.check('a07-create-b-id', bool(id_b), f'创建记录乙返回 id={id_b!r}')\n140: \n141:         if not (id_a and id_b):\n142:             return\n143: \n144:         by_title = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-title', {'q': shared})\n145:         title_ids = _record_ids(by_title)\n146:         recorder.check('a07-title-hit-a', id_a in title_ids, f'标题片段 {shared!r} 命中记录甲：{sorted(title_ids)}')\n147:         recorder.check('a07-title-hit-b', id_b in title_ids, f'标题片段 {shared!r} 命中记录乙：{sorted(title_ids)}')\n148: \n149:         upper_title = shared.upper()\n150:         by_title_upper = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-title-case', {'q': upper_title})\n151:         recorder.check(\n152:             'a07-title-case-insensitive',\n153:             id_a in _record_ids(by_title_upper),\n154:             f'大写标题片段 {upper_title!r} 命中记录甲（大小写不敏感）',\n155:         )\n156: \n157:         by_host = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-domain', {'q': host_token})\n158:         host_ids = _record_ids(by_host)\n159:         recorder.check('a07-domain-hit', id_a in host_ids, f'域名片段 {host_token!r} 命中记录甲：{sorted(host_ids)}')\n160:         recorder.check('a07-domain-excludes-b', id_b not in host_ids, '域名检索不命中域名不同的记录乙')\n161: \n162:         by_host_upper = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-domain-case', {'q': host_token.upper()})\n163:         recorder.check(\n164:             'a07-domain-case-insensitive',\n165:             id_a in _record_ids(by_host_upper),\n166:             f'大写域名片段 {host_token.upper()!r} 命中记录甲（大小写不敏感）',\n167:         )\n168: \n169:         by_desc = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-description', {'q': desc_token})\n170:         desc_ids = _record_ids(by_desc)\n171:         recorder.check('a07-description-hit', id_a in desc_ids, f'描述片段 {desc_token!r} 命中记录甲：{sorted(desc_ids)}')\n172:         recorder.check('a07-description-excludes-b', id_b not in desc_ids, '描述检索不命中无该描述的记录乙')\n173: \n174:         by_desc_upper = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-description-case', {'q': desc_token.upper()})\n175:         recorder.check(\n176:             'a07-description-case-insensitive',\n177:             id_a in _record_ids(by_desc_upper),\n178:             f'大写描述片段 {desc_token.upper()!r} 命中记录甲（大小写不敏感）',\n179:         )\n180: \n181:         combined_a = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-combined-a', {'category': cat_a, 'q': shared})\n182:         combined_a_ids = _record_ids(combined_a)\n183:         recorder.check('a07-combined-a-includes', id_a in combined_a_ids, f'category={cat_a!r} 与 q={shared!r} 叠加命中记录甲')\n184:         recorder.check('a07-combined-a-excludes-b', id_b not in combined_a_ids, f'category={cat_a!r} 叠加过滤排除属于 {cat_b!r} 的记录乙')\n185: \n186:         combined_b = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-combined-b', {'category': cat_b, 'q': shared})\n187:         combined_b_ids = _record_ids(combined_b)\n188:         recorder.check('a07-combined-b-includes', id_b in combined_b_ids, f'category={cat_b!r} 与 q={shared!r} 叠加命中记录乙')\n189:         recorder.check('a07-combined-b-excludes-a', id_a not in combined_b_ids, f'category={cat_b!r} 叠加过滤排除属于 {cat_a!r} 的记录甲')\n190: \n191:         empty = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-no-match', {'q': unmatched})\n192:         recorder.check('a07-no-match-empty', empty == [], f'无匹配关键字 {unmatched!r} 返回 200 空数组，实际 {len(empty)} 条')\n193:     finally:\n194:         client.close()\n195: \n196: \n197: def _case_a08(args, recorder):\n198:     client = common.HttpClient(args.base_url)\n199:     try:\n200:         health = client.get('/api/health')\n201:         recorder.expect_status(health, 200, aid='a08-health-status')\n202: \n203:         host_token = f'open{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n204:         path_token = uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]\n205:         target_url = f'https://{host_token}.atlas-acceptance.example/page/{path_token}?src=atlas&n=7'\n206:         created = client.post_json('/api/bookmarks', {'url': target_url, 'title': 'A08 打开原页'})\n207:         recorder.expect_status(created, 201, aid='a08-create-status')\n208:         record_id = _record_id(_extract_record(_safe_json(created)))\n209:         recorder.check('a08-create-id', bool(record_id), f'创建记录返回 id={record_id!r}')\n210: \n211:         if record_id:\n212:             opened = client.get(_go_path(record_id), follow_redirects=False)\n213:             recorder.expect_status(opened, 302, aid='a08-open-status')\n214:             location = opened.location\n215:             recorder.check('a08-open-location-present', bool(location), f'302 响应携带 Location 头：{location!r}')\n216:             recorder.check(\n217:                 'a08-open-location',\n218:                 location == target_url,\n219:                 f'GET /go/{{id}} Location={location!r}（期望保存时 URL {target_url!r}）',\n220:             )\n221: \n222:         unknown = f'no-such-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n223:         missing = client.get(_go_path(unknown), follow_redirects=False)\n224:         recorder.expect_status(missing, 404, aid='a08-unknown-status')\n225:         code = _error_code(missing)\n226:         recorder.check('a08-unknown-code', code == 'not_found', f'未知 id 打开错误码={code!r}（期望 not_found）')\n227: \n228:         if record_id:\n229:             fetched = client.get(_bookmark_path(record_id))\n230:             recorder.expect_status(fetched, 200, aid='a08-readback-status')\n231:             stored = _extract_record(_safe_json(fetched))\n232:             recorder.check(\n233:                 'a08-url-unchanged',\n234:                 _record_url(stored) == target_url,\n235:                 f'打开动作后记录 url={_record_url(stored)!r}（未被改写，期望 {target_url!r}）',\n236:             )\n237:     finally:\n238:         client.close()\n239: \n240: \n241: _HANDLERS = {\n242:     'A07': _case_a07,\n243:     'A08': _case_a08,\n244: }\n245: \n246: \n247: def main(argv=None):\n248:     args = common.parse_case_args(argv)\n249:     recorder = common.Recorder(args.case)\n250:     handler = _HANDLERS.get(args.case)\n251:     if handler is None:\n252:         recorder.check(\n253:             'dispatch',\n254:             False,\n255:             f'acceptance/p0_find_open.py 不实现用例 {args.case}（应由其他程序派发）',\n256:         )\n257:     else:\n258:         try:\n259:             handler(args, recorder)\n260:         except common.AcceptanceError as exc:\n261:             recorder.check('infrastructure', False, f'验收基础设施错误：{exc}')\n262:         except Exception as exc:\n263:             recorder.check('unexpected-error', False, f'未预期错误：{type(exc).__name__}: {exc}')\n264:     return recorder.finish(args.case)\n265: \n266: \n267: if __name__ == '__main__':\n268:     sys.exit(main())","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file source/previous/acceptance/p0_find_open.py, lines 1-268\n1: #!/usr/bin/env python3\n2: '''P0 行为验收组：关键字检索与打开原页。\n3: \n4: 覆盖 A07、A08。仅使用 Python 3.12 标准库并复用 acceptance/common.py：\n5: 以 --case 派发，未知用例显式失败；每个用例对真实目标执行正向与硬负向\n6: 行为断言，向 stdout 输出单个 atlas.acceptance-result.v1 JSON，失败时以\n7: 非零码退出。\n8: '''\n9: \n10: from __future__ import annotations\n11: \n12: import os\n13: import sys\n14: import uuid\n15: from urllib.parse import quote\n16: \n17: _THIS_DIR = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n18: if _THIS_DIR not in sys.path:\n19:     sys.path.insert(0, _THIS_DIR)\n20: \n21: import common\n22: \n23: \n24: def _unique_url(tag):\n25:     token = f'{tag}-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n26:     return f'https://{token}.atlas-acceptance.example/{token}'\n27: \n28: \n29: def _unique_category(tag):\n30:     return f'atlas-{tag}-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:10]}'\n31: \n32: \n33: def _safe_json(response):\n34:     try:\n35:         return response.json()\n36:     except Exception:\n37:         return None\n38: \n39: \n40: def _extract_record(payload):\n41:     if isinstance(payload, dict):\n42:         for key in ('bookmark', 'record', 'data', 'item'):\n43:             value = payload.get(key)\n44:             if isinstance(value, dict):\n45:                 return value\n46:         return payload\n47:     return None\n48: \n49: \n50: def _record_id(record):\n51:     if isinstance(record, dict) and record.get('id') is not None:\n52:         return str(record['id'])\n53:     return None\n54: \n55: \n56: def _record_url(record):\n57:     if isinstance(record, dict) and record.get('url') is not None:\n58:         return str(record['url'])\n59:     return None\n60: \n61: \n62: def _record_ids(records):\n63:     return {item_id for item_id in (_record_id(record) for record in records) if item_id}\n64: \n65: \n66: def _error_code(response):\n67:     payload = _safe_json(response)\n68:     if isinstance(payload, dict):\n69:         error = payload.get('error')\n70:         if isinstance(error, dict) and error.get('code') is not None:\n71:             return str(error['code'])\n72:         for key in ('code', 'error_code'):\n73:             if payload.get(key) is not None:\n74:                 return str(payload[key])\n75:     return None\n76: \n77: \n78: def _extract_list(payload, keys):\n79:     if isinstance(payload, list):\n80:         return payload\n81:     if isinstance(payload, dict):\n82:         for key in keys:\n83:             value = payload.get(key)\n84:             if isinstance(value, list):\n85:                 return value\n86:     return None\n87: \n88: \n89: def _bookmark_path(bookmark_id):\n90:     return '/api/bookmarks/' + quote(str(bookmark_id), safe='')\n91: \n92: \n93: def _go_path(bookmark_id):\n94:     return '/go/' + quote(str(bookmark_id), safe='')\n95: \n96: \n97: def _search(client, recorder, aid, params):\n98:     response = client.get('/api/bookmarks', params=params)\n99:     recorder.expect_status(response, 200, aid=f'{aid}-status')\n100:     payload = _safe_json(response)\n101:     records = _extract_list(payload, ('bookmarks', 'items', 'data', 'records'))\n102:     recorder.check(\n103:         f'{aid}-shape',\n104:         isinstance(records, list),\n105:         f'GET /api/bookmarks 必须返回 JSON 数组，实际 {type(payload).__name__}',\n106:     )\n107:     return records if isinstance(records, list) else []\n108: \n109: \n110: def _case_a07(args, recorder):\n111:     client = common.HttpClient(args.base_url)\n112:     try:\n113:         health = client.get('/api/health')\n114:         recorder.expect_status(health, 200, aid='a07-health-status')\n115: \n116:         cat_a = _unique_category('a07a')\n117:         cat_b = _unique_category('a07b')\n118:         shared = f'shared{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n119:         host_token = f'host{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n120:         desc_token = f'descr{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n121:         unmatched = f'absent{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n122: \n123:         url_a = f'https://{host_token}.atlas-acceptance.example/notes/{uuid.uuid4().hex[:10]}'\n124:         title_a = f'{shared} 收藏甲'\n125:         desc_a = f'备注 {desc_token}'\n126:         created_a = client.post_json(\n127:             '/api/bookmarks',\n128:             {'url': url_a, 'title': title_a, 'description': desc_a, 'category': cat_a},\n129:         )\n130:         recorder.expect_status(created_a, 201, aid='a07-create-a-status')\n131:         id_a = _record_id(_extract_record(_safe_json(created_a)))\n132:         recorder.check('a07-create-a-id', bool(id_a), f'创建记录甲返回 id={id_a!r}')\n133: \n134:         url_b = _unique_url('a07b')\n135:         title_b = f'{shared} 收藏乙'\n136:         created_b = client.post_json('/api/bookmarks', {'url': url_b, 'title': title_b, 'category': cat_b})\n137:         recorder.expect_status(created_b, 201, aid='a07-create-b-status')\n138:         id_b = _record_id(_extract_record(_safe_json(created_b)))\n139:         recorder.check('a07-create-b-id', bool(id_b), f'创建记录乙返回 id={id_b!r}')\n140: \n141:         if not (id_a and id_b):\n142:             return\n143: \n144:         by_title = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-title', {'q': shared})\n145:         title_ids = _record_ids(by_title)\n146:         recorder.check('a07-title-hit-a', id_a in title_ids, f'标题片段 {shared!r} 命中记录甲：{sorted(title_ids)}')\n147:         recorder.check('a07-title-hit-b', id_b in title_ids, f'标题片段 {shared!r} 命中记录乙：{sorted(title_ids)}')\n148: \n149:         upper_title = shared.upper()\n150:         by_title_upper = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-title-case', {'q': upper_title})\n151:         recorder.check(\n152:             'a07-title-case-insensitive',\n153:             id_a in _record_ids(by_title_upper),\n154:             f'大写标题片段 {upper_title!r} 命中记录甲（大小写不敏感）',\n155:         )\n156: \n157:         by_host = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-domain', {'q': host_token})\n158:         host_ids = _record_ids(by_host)\n159:         recorder.check('a07-domain-hit', id_a in host_ids, f'域名片段 {host_token!r} 命中记录甲：{sorted(host_ids)}')\n160:         recorder.check('a07-domain-excludes-b', id_b not in host_ids, '域名检索不命中域名不同的记录乙')\n161: \n162:         by_host_upper = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-domain-case', {'q': host_token.upper()})\n163:         recorder.check(\n164:             'a07-domain-case-insensitive',\n165:             id_a in _record_ids(by_host_upper),\n166:             f'大写域名片段 {host_token.upper()!r} 命中记录甲（大小写不敏感）',\n167:         )\n168: \n169:         by_desc = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-description', {'q': desc_token})\n170:         desc_ids = _record_ids(by_desc)\n171:         recorder.check('a07-description-hit', id_a in desc_ids, f'描述片段 {desc_token!r} 命中记录甲：{sorted(desc_ids)}')\n172:         recorder.check('a07-description-excludes-b', id_b not in desc_ids, '描述检索不命中无该描述的记录乙')\n173: \n174:         by_desc_upper = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-description-case', {'q': desc_token.upper()})\n175:         recorder.check(\n176:             'a07-description-case-insensitive',\n177:             id_a in _record_ids(by_desc_upper),\n178:             f'大写描述片段 {desc_token.upper()!r} 命中记录甲（大小写不敏感）',\n179:         )\n180: \n181:         combined_a = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-combined-a', {'category': cat_a, 'q': shared})\n182:         combined_a_ids = _record_ids(combined_a)\n183:         recorder.check('a07-combined-a-includes', id_a in combined_a_ids, f'category={cat_a!r} 与 q={shared!r} 叠加命中记录甲')\n184:         recorder.check('a07-combined-a-excludes-b', id_b not in combined_a_ids, f'category={cat_a!r} 叠加过滤排除属于 {cat_b!r} 的记录乙')\n185: \n186:         combined_b = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-combined-b', {'category': cat_b, 'q': shared})\n187:         combined_b_ids = _record_ids(combined_b)\n188:         recorder.check('a07-combined-b-includes', id_b in combined_b_ids, f'category={cat_b!r} 与 q={shared!r} 叠加命中记录乙')\n189:         recorder.check('a07-combined-b-excludes-a', id_a not in combined_b_ids, f'category={cat_b!r} 叠加过滤排除属于 {cat_a!r} 的记录甲')\n190: \n191:         empty = _search(client, recorder, 'a07-no-match', {'q': unmatched})\n192:         recorder.check('a07-no-match-empty', empty == [], f'无匹配关键字 {unmatched!r} 返回 200 空数组，实际 {len(empty)} 条')\n193:     finally:\n194:         client.close()\n195: \n196: \n197: def _case_a08(args, recorder):\n198:     client = common.HttpClient(args.base_url)\n199:     try:\n200:         health = client.get('/api/health')\n201:         recorder.expect_status(health, 200, aid='a08-health-status')\n202: \n203:         host_token = f'open{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n204:         path_token = uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]\n205:         target_url = f'https://{host_token}.atlas-acceptance.example/page/{path_token}?src=atlas&n=7'\n206:         created = client.post_json('/api/bookmarks', {'url': target_url, 'title': 'A08 打开原页'})\n207:         recorder.expect_status(created, 201, aid='a08-create-status')\n208:         record_id = _record_id(_extract_record(_safe_json(created)))\n209:         recorder.check('a08-create-id', bool(record_id), f'创建记录返回 id={record_id!r}')\n210: \n211:         if record_id:\n212:             opened = client.get(_go_path(record_id), follow_redirects=False)\n213:             recorder.expect_status(opened, 302, aid='a08-open-status')\n214:             location = opened.location\n215:             recorder.check('a08-open-location-present', bool(location), f'302 响应携带 Location 头：{location!r}')\n216:             recorder.check(\n217:                 'a08-open-location',\n218:                 location == target_url,\n219:                 f'GET /go/{{id}} Location={location!r}（期望保存时 URL {target_url!r}）',\n220:             )\n221: \n222:         unknown = f'no-such-{uuid.uuid4().hex[:12]}'\n223:         missing = client.get(_go_path(unknown), follow_redirects=False)\n224:         recorder.expect_status(missing, 404, aid='a08-unknown-status')\n225:         code = _error_code(missing)\n226:         recorder.check('a08-unknown-code', code == 'not_found', f'未知 id 打开错误码={code!r}（期望 not_found）')\n227: \n228:         if record_id:\n229:             fetched = client.get(_bookmark_path(record_id))\n230:             recorder.expect_status(fetched, 200, aid='a08-readback-status')\n231:             stored = _extract_record(_safe_json(fetched))\n232:             recorder.check(\n233:                 'a08-url-unchanged',\n234:                 _record_url(stored) == target_url,\n235:                 f'打开动作后记录 url={_record_url(stored)!r}（未被改写，期望 {target_url!r}）',\n236:             )\n237:     finally:\n238:         client.close()\n239: \n240: \n241: _HANDLERS = {\n242:     'A07': _case_a07,\n243:     'A08': _case_a08,\n244: }\n245: \n246: \n247: def main(argv=None):\n248:     args = common.parse_case_args(argv)\n249:     recorder = common.Recorder(args.case)\n250:     handler = _HANDLERS.get(args.case)\n251:     if handler is None:\n252:         recorder.check(\n253:             'dispatch',\n254:             False,\n255:             f'acceptance/p0_find_open.py 不实现用例 {args.case}（应由其他程序派发）',\n256:         )\n257:     else:\n258:         try:\n259:             handler(args, recorder)\n260:         except common.AcceptanceError as exc:\n261:             recorder.check('infrastructure', False, f'验收基础设施错误：{exc}')\n262:         except Exception as exc:\n263:             recorder.check('unexpected-error', False, f'未预期错误：{type(exc).__name__}: {exc}')\n264:     return recorder.finish(args.case)\n265: \n266: \n267: if __name__ == '__main__':\n268:     sys.exit(main())"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"source/previous/acceptance/p0_find_open.py\"}"},"time":{"start":1792434490439,"end":1792434490576}}}}
